      "id": 1,
      "title": "How to use this dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "options": {
        "content": "# EADS Multi-Operator Control Plane\n\nUse **Selected operator** to switch between operator-specific PostgreSQL datasources.\n\nThis dashboard is optimized for a live 5-minute view with **smoothed 1-second averages** in the charts, plus 1-hour average KPIs at the top.\n\nFilters apply to all panels:\n- Sensor\n- Location\n- Anomaly\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    },
